>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/01\/2017-01-25-10.02.24.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/01\/2017-01-25-10.02.24.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-3155\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/01\/2017-01-25-10.02.24.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/01\/2017-01-25-10.02.24-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/01\/2017-01-25-10.02.24-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/01\/2017-01-25-10.02.24-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-1-3155'>\n\t\t\t\tThe movable crane that lifts the gates to the hydroelectric plant\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/01\/2017-01-25-10.01.49.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/01\/2017-01-25-10.01.49.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-3154\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/01\/2017-01-25-10.01.49.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/01\/2017-01-25-10.01.49-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/01\/2017-01-25-10.01.49-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/01\/2017-01-25-10.01.49-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-1-3154'>\n\t\t\t\tThe crane rolls on the rails in the concrete floor\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/01\/2017-01-25-09.59.24.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/01\/2017-01-25-09.59.24.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-3153\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/01\/2017-01-25-09.59.24.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/01\/2017-01-25-09.59.24-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/01\/2017-01-25-09.59.24-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/01\/2017-01-25-09.59.24-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-1-3153'>\n\t\t\t\tView as we approach the road over the dam\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n<p>I was, of course, fascinated by the dam and how they move the water through the gates and into the hydro-electric plant. \u00a0But we both enjoyed the beauty of the blue water and the majestic mountains of the area.<\/p>\n<p>Kathy had read to me in the car that the London Bridge there at Lake Havasu City IS the actual bridge from London, England, (I assumed it was a replica). But no, the fella that developed the city purchased the bridge from the city of London.<\/p>\n<p>Here&#8217;s an excerpt from <a href=\"http:\/\/www.golakehavasu.com\/about-us\/london_bridge1.aspx\">golakehavasu.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>&#8220;<em>In 1967, the Common Council of the City of London began to look for potential buyers for the London Bridge. Lake Havasu City founder and entrepreneur Robert P. McCulloch placed the winning bid of $2,460,000 on April 18, 1968.<\/em><\/p>\n<p><em>McCulloch came by this figure by doubling the estimated cost of dismantling the structure, which was $1.2 million, bringing the price to $2.4 million. He then added on $60,000 \u2013 a thousand dollars for each year of his age at the time he estimated the bridge would be reconstructed in Arizona.<\/em><\/p>\n<p><em>Each block was meticulously numbered before the bridge was disassembled. The blocks were then shipped overseas through the Panama Canal to California and trucked from Long Beach to Arizona. Following reconstruction of the London Bridge, Lake Havasu City rededicated it in a ceremony on October 10, 1971. Since then, it has consistently remained a favorite among Arizona attractions, drawing in visitors from around the globe.&#8221;<\/em><\/p>\n<p>After knowing THIS information, it certainly made me have a much higher respect for the bridge and the effort of so many to bring it here to Arizona.<\/p>\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/01\/2017-01-25-12.15.56.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-3177 aligncenter\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/01\/2017-01-25-12.15.56.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"7232\" height=\"2160\" \/><\/a><\/p>\n<div style=\"width: 685px;\" class=\"wp-video\"><video class=\"wp-video-shortcode\" id=\"video-3151-1\" width=\"685\" height=\"385\" preload=\"metadata\" controls=\"controls\"><source type=\"video\/mp4\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/02\/LakeHavasuParkerDam.mp4?_=1\" \/><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/02\/LakeHavasuParkerDam.mp4\">https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/02\/LakeHavasuParkerDam.mp4<\/a><\/video><\/div>\n<p>Stay tuned &#8230; more to follow from the Quartzsite trip (Bill Williams Wildlife Refuge &amp; &#8220;The Naked Bookseller&#8221;)<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>While we were at Quartzsite, we decided to take another day trip and be able to check something off our bucket list. \u00a0We wanted to see Lake Havasu and London Bridge. \u00a0One of our fellow workampers suggested we be sure to take a small detour on our way to check out Parker Dam at Parker, &hellip; <a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2017\/02\/01\/lake-havasu-parker-dam\/\" class=\"more-link\">Continue reading <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Lake Havasu &#038; Parker Dam<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":3157,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[19546],"tags":[24592,554707265,554707266,13789,554707262,18086,554707261,554707263,554707264,445178,3559,14157],"class_list":["post-3151","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-sightseeing","tag-arizona","tag-boats","tag-dam","tag-dinner","tag-havasu","tag-lake","tag-lake-havasu","tag-parker","tag-parker-dam","tag-quartzite","tag-rv","tag-water"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/3151","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=3151"}],"version-history":[{"count":5,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/3151\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":3255,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/3151\/revisions\/3255"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/3157"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=3151"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=3151